  "text": "Mess Buachalla is an Irish goddess. Her name means the cow herder's fosterling. She was the daughter of the fairy queen Étain and of the king Eochaid. Mess Buachalla grew into a woman of great beauty. She married a high king. With the bird-god Nemglan, she became the mother of the king Conaire.",
